{\fontsize{22}{26}\selectfont\bfseries\kaiti\selectfont 出埃及記研讀}\\[0.08cm]
{\fontsize{13}{16}\selectfont\itshape\color{TextGray} A Study of the Book of Exodus}

\vspace{0.24cm}
